                                "sense_id": "cbb1e29a-1d60-3da1-a722-f9f74ebf4ddb",
                                "text": "The government announced a new initiative to help the jobless."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c37f1e46-3915-485e-aada-e3e788a06b1f",
                                "sense_id": "cbb1e29a-1d60-3da1-a722-f9f74ebf4ddb",
                                "text": "The report was slightly gloomier than in June, when unemployment rates eased in more than half of all U.S. states for a third straight month and only five states reported jobless rate increases."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
